    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Delivers a plain HTML and CSS landing page with client-side form validation and confirmation, and no network call. Separately, it persists a LeadRequest entity with its RequestType and status enums, approved descriptors and default form. It exposes the entity through an observer sheet that lists newest first, and builds the staff Lead requests screen from its mock, registered under Sales › Lead requests. The work is four tasks."
