    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : " (plain HTML and CSS, no framework, no server). The sections appear in this order: hero with a call-to-action anchor scrolling to the form, featured models, key features, testimonials, lead request form, contact (address, phone, opening hours). The form has fullName, email, phone, requestType (test drive or quote), preferredModel and message. Inline script validates on submit. It shows a message beside each offending field (empty name, no request type, empty or invalid email) and no confirmation. Otherwise it shows a confirmation and makes no network request. The layout is fluid with no horizontal scroll from 320 px to 1920 px. This task must NOT touch the LeadRequest entity; the form is not connected to it."
